WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.942 --> 00:00:15.081
The rain and wind finally stopped.

2
00:00:15.082 --> 00:00:19.055
Sonia looked out her window.

3
00:00:19.056 --> 00:00:23.438
The whole neighborhood was flooded.

4
00:00:23.439 --> 00:00:28.589
And next door someone was trapped in the tree house!

5
00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:33.384
It was her neighbor Tim.

6
00:00:33.385 --> 00:00:37.323
He looked scared.

7
00:00:37.324 --> 00:00:41.061
"Help!" the boy yelled.

8
00:00:41.062 --> 00:00:44.413
"I'm trapped up here!"

9
00:00:44.414 --> 00:00:46.691
The floodwater was high.

10
00:00:46.692 --> 00:00:51.118
Tim could not climb down the ladder.

11
00:00:51.119 --> 00:00:55.853
"Stay up there," Sonia yelled to Tim.

12
00:00:55.854 --> 00:01:00.332
"I will call for help."

13
00:01:00.333 --> 00:01:06.860
She quickly found the phone and dialed 9-1-1.

14
00:01:06.861 --> 00:01:09.194
"This is the 9-1-1 operator.

15
00:01:09.195 --> 00:01:12.890
What is your emergency?" the operator asked.

16
00:01:12.891 --> 00:01:16.764
"We need help!" Sonia cried.

17
00:01:16.765 --> 00:01:20.460
"Our backyards are flooded.

18
00:01:20.461 --> 00:01:25.097
And my neighbor is trapped in his tree house!"

19
00:01:25.098 --> 00:01:29.279
"What is your address?" the operator asked.

20
00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:35.180
"Seven Bell Avenue in Dover," Sonia said.

21
00:01:35.181 --> 00:01:40.234
"Stay calm and stay on the phone," the operator said.

22
00:01:40.235 --> 00:01:43.585
"What is your name? Are you safe?"

23
00:01:43.586 --> 00:01:46.706
"My name is Sonia Rivera.

24
00:01:46.707 --> 00:01:51.726
Yes, I'm safe in my house with my parents."

25
00:01:51.727 --> 00:01:54.262
"Help is on the way.

26
00:01:54.263 --> 00:01:58.679
Do not hang up the phone," the operator said.

27
00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:02.368
Soon Sonia heard sirens.

28
00:02:02.369 --> 00:02:08.313
An ambulance and other emergency trucks arrived.

29
00:02:08.314 --> 00:02:12.594
"Help is here," she said to the operator.

30
00:02:12.595 --> 00:02:19.747
Sonia hung up the phone.

31
00:02:19.748 --> 00:02:25.044
Then she and her parents watched the rescue.

32
00:02:25.045 --> 00:02:31.517
The rescue workers went to the tree house in a boat.

33
00:02:31.518 --> 00:02:36.450
They helped Tim out of the tree house.

34
00:02:36.451 --> 00:02:42.391
Then they took him to the ambulance.

35
00:02:42.392 --> 00:02:47.959
"Thank you, Sonia!" Tim said.

36
00:02:47.960 --> 00:02:53.205
He didn't look scared anymore.

37
00:02:53.206 --> 00:02:58.436
A rescue worker came to the front door.

38
00:02:58.437 --> 00:03:02.518
"You did the right thing," he said to Sonia.

39
00:03:02.519 --> 00:03:06.645
"You called 9-1-1 and stayed calm.

40
00:03:06.646 --> 00:03:13.253
You saved Tim's life today."
